      "text": "\u2022 Chat UI: user types a message\n\u2022 POST /chat to OUR backend\n\u2022 Shows the reply\n\u2022 Holds NO secrets\n\nReact \u00b7 Next.js \u00b7 mobile app\n(today: client.html)",
