      "text": "\u2022 Receives instructions + input\n\u2022 Runs inference on a hosted model\n\u2022 Returns text\n  + usage (tokens in / out)\n\nOpenAI \u00b7 Anthropic \u00b7 Gemini\n(today: gpt-4o-mini, or a mock)",
